# The daukle checkout the harness builds against, at the ROOT only. Unanchored this matches at
# every depth, and it would swallow an example's own .daukle/wrapper.toml: present locally,
# absent from a clone, and the wrapper then reports a missing pin file in CI alone.
/.daukle/
test/.work/
# Anchored for the same reason as the line above: unanchored it swallows a case's
# expected/build/daukle/gradle/build.gradle, which is then present locally and
# absent from the clone CI runs, and compare_expected asserts only what it finds.
/build/
test/.work-examples/
